          "name": "get_example",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:4da306d018f40239c29cce14ff3f239a3830ed3494005d87a093277be93bcc97",
          "description": "Get the smallest valid document of one kind, as JSON ready to edit: the fastest way to the right field names. `kind` is one exact value from `list_kinds`, e.g. `flow`. Use it after `list_kinds` has settled the kind, and `get_schema` only for a field the example leaves out. Static and local: the document `drawspec example <kind>` prints, under 1 KB, identical every call; it passes `validate_document` as is. An unknown kind is an error result naming `list_kinds`.",
